## Step 2 — Add the Drizzle Schema

Append to `drizzle/schema.ts`:

```ts
// SharePoint CRM lead database
export const cgLeads = mysqlTable("lt_mns_cg_leads", {
  id: int("id").primaryKey(),
  companyName: text("company_name").notNull(),
  website: text("website"),
  domain: text("domain"),
  sharepointUrl: text("sharepoint_url").notNull(),
  createdAt: timestamp("created_at").defaultNow(),
});

export type CgLead = typeof cgLeads.$inferSelect;
```

> No migration needed — the table was already created by the import script in Step 1.

