## Matching Logic

| Priority | Method | How |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | **Exact domain** | Strips `www.`, matches `lt_mns_cg_leads.domain` |
| 2 | **Fuzzy name** | Lowercases, strips BV/GmbH/Ltd/Inc etc., SQL `LIKE` prefix filter + exact JS comparison |

---

## Customisation

| What | Where |
|---|---|
| Button label "View in CRM" | `CgLeadBadge.tsx` — change the text |
| Green / grey colours | `CgLeadBadge.tsx` — change Tailwind classes |
| Table name | `--table` flag in import script + schema table name |
| Cache duration | `staleTime` in `CgLeadBadge.tsx` |
| Additional match fields | Extend `findCgLead()` in `server/db.ts` |
